dictionaries/private/*
!dictionaries/private/README.md
/tisane
/tisane-cli
/tisane-build
/tisane-extract
*.exe
cmd/tisane/frontend/node_modules/
cmd/tisane/frontend/dist/
cmd/tisane/rsrc_windows_*.syso
/bazel-*
release/
